Scope of this license and third-party notices

- This MIT license covers the source code in this repository (src/, tools/,
  test/, e2e/, catalog.html, index.html, configuration files).
- Pixel-art image assets under assets/sprites/ and assets/gen/raw/ were
  produced with Gemini 2.5 Flash Image from prompts in assets/gen/prompts/
  and post-processed by tools/ in this repository. They are distributed with
  the game under the same MIT terms as far as the copyright holder above can
  grant them; see docs/release/known-issues.md for the note on AI-generated
  assets.
- Font: DotGothic16 (assets/fonts/DotGothic16-Regular.ttf), Copyright 2020
  The DotGothic16 Project Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License
  1.1 (assets/fonts/OFL.txt). It is not covered by the MIT license above.
- Music and sound effects are synthesized at runtime by src/audio.js; no
  third-party audio is included.
